"entity": {
"name": "Koninklijke Heijmans N.V.",
"description": "Koninklijke Heijmans NV engages in the provision of building and construction services. It operates through the following segments: Living, Working, and Connecting. The Living segment is composed of products and services relating to area and building development, housing construction, and residential renovation. The Working segment consists of activities related to the development, construction, and maintenance of commercial and public buildings. The Connecting segment refers to products and services centered on building and managing infrastructure, including roads, bridges, tunnels, waterworks, and energy systems, with a focus on replacements, data-driven maintenance, and supporting the energy transition through grid reinforcements. The company was founded by Jan Heijmans in 1923 and is headquartered in Rosmalen, the Netherlands.",
